.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "2026-09-25" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words, and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fB#include "myfilefunctions.h"\fP
.sp
.BI "int wordCount(FILE *" file ", int *" lines ", int *" words ", int *" chars );
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR wordCount ()
function reads the file stream pointed to by
.I file
from its current position to end-of-file, and fills in the number of
newline-terminated lines, whitespace-separated words, and total
characters read into
.IR lines ,
.IR words ,
and
.IR chars
respectively.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success. Returns \-1 if
.IR file ,
.IR lines ,
.IR words ,
or
.I chars
is NULL.
